// SAMPLE DATA PATTERNS\
\
Pattern: Person holds Position in Organization\
Example: (Jane Smith)-[HOLDS_POSITION]->(Chief of Staff)-[BELONGS_TO]->(White House)\
\
Pattern: Person transitions between Positions\
Example: (John Doe)-[TRANSITIONED_FROM]->(Deputy Director)-[TRANSITIONED_TO]->(Director)\
\
Pattern: Newsletter mentions Person at Event\
Example: (Politico Playbook March 15)-[MENTIONED_IN]->(Senator Smith)-[ATTENDED]->(Fundraiser)-[LOCATED_AT]->(Capitol Hill Club)\
\
Pattern: Person seen with Person at Location\
Example: (Senator A)-[SEEN_WITH]->(Senator B) with relationship property location: "Le Diplomate restaurant"\
\
Pattern: Committee membership\
Example: (Representative Johnson)-[MEMBER_OF \{role: "chair"\}]->(House Ways and Means Committee)-[COMMITTEE_OF]->(House of Representatives)\
\
Pattern: Media appearance tracking\
Example: (Secretary Smith)-[APPEARED_ON]->(CNN State of the Union March 10)-[topic: "foreign policy"]\
\
Pattern: Organizational hierarchy\
Example: (Department of State)-[PARENT_OF]->(Bureau of European Affairs)-[PARENT_OF]->(Office of Nordic Affairs)\
\
// KEY PATTERNS FOR POLITICO PLAYBOOK EXTRACTION\
\
1. Personnel Changes:\
(Person)-[TRANSITIONED_FROM]->(Old Position) and (Person)-[TRANSITIONED_TO]->(New Position)\
\
2. Social Networks:\
(Person A)-[SEEN_WITH]->(Person B) at events, restaurants, meetings\
\
3. Career Trajectories:\
Path: (Person)-[HOLDS_POSITION*]->(Position)-[BELONGS_TO]->(Organization)\
\
4. Power Structures:\
(Person A)-[REPORTS_TO]->(Person B) within (Organization)\
\
5. Event Networks:\
(Event)-[ATTENDED_BY]->(multiple Persons) and (Event)-[HOSTED_BY]->(Organization)\
\
6. Media Influence:\
(Person)-[APPEARED_ON]->(Media) tracked over time\
\
7. Source Tracking:\
(Newsletter)-[MENTIONED_IN/DESCRIBES]->(Entity) for data provenance\
